curl "https://secure.runescape.com/m=hiscore/index_lite.ws?player=Zezima"
→ 781 bytes response (valid CSV with 62+ lines)
```

**Hiscores works. Runemetrics is dead.**

The 46-byte response from Runemetrics is almost certainly:
```json
{"error":"PROFILE_PRIVATE"}
```
or
```json
{"error":"NO_PROFILE"}
```

The Runemetrics endpoints are **non-functional** for public queries post-shutdown. Only hiscores remain viable.

