The syntax error is in `WikiEquipmentEnricher.ts` line 744. The issue is unescaped single quotes inside single-quoted strings:

```typescript
// BROKEN:
if (lower.includes('{{infobox location') || lower.includes('{{infobox area')) return 'place';
if (lower.includes('{{infobox mechanic') || lower.includes('{{infobox gameplay'))) return 'mechanic';
```

The `'` inside `'{{infobox location'` terminates the string early. Same problem on line 744.

**Fix:**

```typescript
// Line 743:
if (lower.includes("{{infobox location") || lower.includes("{{infobox area")) return 'place';

// Line 744:
if (lower.includes("{{infobox mechanic") || lower.includes("{{infobox gameplay")) return 'mechanic';
```

Use double quotes for strings containing single quotes.

**Quick fix via sed:**

```bash
cd D:\POG2
sed -i "s/lower.includes('{{infobox location')/lower.includes(\"{{infobox location\")/g" src/utils/WikiEquipmentEnricher.ts
sed -i "s/lower.includes('{{infobox area')/lower.includes(\"{{infobox area\")/g" src/utils/WikiEquipmentEnricher.ts
sed -i "s/lower.includes('{{infobox mechanic')/lower.includes(\"{{infobox mechanic\")/g" src/utils/WikiEquipmentEnricher.ts
